    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>arrow normal to the orbit towards the Earth ✓</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b.i\"><p><strong>b.i</strong></p><p>use of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"{v}_{o r b i t a l} = \\frac{2 π r}{T}\"></span> AND either <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{orbital}=\\sqrt{\\frac{GM}{r}}\"></span> or <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mv_{orbital}^{2}}{r}=\\frac{GMm}{r^{2}}\"></span> correctly manipulated ✓ «to yield <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T^{2}=\\frac{4\\pi^{2}}{GM}r^{3}\"></span>» Allow use of ω.</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b.ii\"><p><strong>b.ii</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r=\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{GMT^{2}}{4\\pi^{2}}}=\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{6.67\\times 10^{-11}\\times 5.97\\times 10^{24}\\times 5620^{2}}{4\\pi^{2}}}\"></span> ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=6.83\\times 10^{6}\"></span> «m» height = «<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6.83\\times 10^{6}-6.37\\times 10^{6}=\"></span>» <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.6\\times 10^{5}\"></span> «m» ✓</p></section>"
